/E (Attention is your most important tool, use it wisely and intentionally. Attention is the tool you have during your waking days, you must be intentional with it. You do not get what you want, you get what you have invested in through your attention. Everything you do is mental. As you think, you are investing \(using your attention\) your mental energies and these mental energies will, always without fail, bring you experiences related to how you invested them. As for your attention, it is the most important tool you have in your toolbox because it determines where your energy \(Thoughts and Emotions\) flows and your energy will lead you to certain actions, behaviours and life experiences; you experience life according to how you invest your Attention; your life events \(things that happen to you\) are determined by how you invest your Attention.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [2]
